# --- Training outputs — keep only the small YOLOv11 checkpoint (18 MB) ---
# Faster R-CNN best.pt (~166 MB) exceeds GitHub's 100 MB limit; train locally
# with `src/faster_rcnn/train.py` or publish via GitHub Releases / Git LFS.
runs/**
runs/faster_rcnn/
!runs/detect/
!runs/detect/parking_yolo11s/
!runs/detect/parking_yolo11s/weights/
!runs/detect/parking_yolo11s/weights/best.pt

